WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.797 --> 00:00:19.963
Bird was reading a book in her nest.

2
00:00:19.964 --> 00:00:22.111
Kip came up the tree.

3
00:00:22.112 --> 00:00:24.909
He was carrying a bunch of sticks.

4
00:00:24.910 --> 00:00:29.667
"Good morning, Bird," said Kip.

5
00:00:29.668 --> 00:00:33.580
"Good morning, Kip," said Bird.

6
00:00:33.581 --> 00:00:35.765
Kip went back down the tree.

7
00:00:35.766 --> 00:00:38.158
Then he came up the tree again.

8
00:00:38.159 --> 00:00:43.303
He was carrying more sticks.

9
00:00:43.304 --> 00:00:48.191
"Hmm," said Bird.

10
00:00:48.192 --> 00:00:52.818
"I wonder what Kip is doing."

11
00:00:52.819 --> 00:00:56.442
Bird went back to reading her book.

12
00:00:56.443 --> 00:00:58.292
Crash!

13
00:00:58.293 --> 00:01:00.747
"Ouch!" cried Bird.

14
00:01:00.748 --> 00:01:05.216
"Please be careful, Kip."

15
00:01:05.217 --> 00:01:08.014
"Sorry about that!" said Kip.

16
00:01:08.015 --> 00:01:11.581
Bird flew up to Kip's branch.

17
00:01:11.582 --> 00:01:16.757
"What are you doing?" asked Bird.

18
00:01:16.758 --> 00:01:22.822
"I'm collecting sticks," said Kip.

19
00:01:22.823 --> 00:01:26.643
"Why do you need sticks?" asked Bird.

20
00:01:26.644 --> 00:01:31.126
"I'm building something," said Kip.

21
00:01:31.127 --> 00:01:35.028
"I need a lot of sticks for it."

22
00:01:35.029 --> 00:01:38.854
"What are you building?" asked Bird.

23
00:01:38.855 --> 00:01:41.149
"A nest," said Kip.

24
00:01:41.150 --> 00:01:46.540
"I'm building a nest for myself!"
